WEBVTT

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.590
<i>What an incredibly strong barrier!</i>

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.190
Ibuki-sama!

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:47.120
It's dangerous to try any more.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.390
Please stop!

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.710
Don't give me orders!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.050
The power of the Shikimori is more than enough to destroy a barrier like this.

00:01:55.990 --> 00:02:00.260
<i>Au Gelan Gerau Grazen La Defam!</i>

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.700
Ibuki-sama!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.950
Are you all right?

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:16.280
I've looked all around this school, but no place has a barrier as strong as this one.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:17.710
I'm sure of it!

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.120
The treasure of the Shikimori lies here!

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:27.430
But as long as we can't break this barrier, we can't even step into this forest.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:29.190
<i>Amslei!</i>

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:32.920
<i>You're going to use her.</i>

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:37.210
Not... Haruhi-dono...

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:41.350
Yes, the mage with the bright name Kartia...

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.840
Kamisaka Haruhi!

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:46.870
If she is the daughter of the woman who stole the treasure of the Shikimori,

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:49.320
she should be able to break this barrier.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:54.820
<b>School Festival</b>

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:00.970
SIGN:  Mizuhosaka Academy School Festival

00:02:55.840 --> 00:03:00.940
The school festival season has come to Mizuhosaka Academy.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:05.170
Ta-da!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.330
So?  How does it look?

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.160
I'm not sure how to answer that.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:13.570
I don't really want to see a guy in a maid outfit...

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:18.450
Oh my, I'm actually the most popular at my part-time job!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.790
What kind of job does he have?

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.370
Uhm, Yuuma-kun?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.260
Does it look good?

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.620
Yeah, a lot.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.510
It looks great, Kamisaka-san!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.900
You are the queen of maids!

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:45.640
Stop being stupid and finish up with the preparations.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:49.060
The school festival starts tomorrow.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.300
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:57.430
Brother, I can't agree to this.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:00.980
Even if it's to take back the treasure of the Shikimori,

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.860
Involving Kamisaka-san...

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.520
I understand your feelings exactly.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:13.860
But it's true that it's easier to have a Kartia mage dispel the barrier a Kartia mage put up.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:19.700
There's no other way except to explain the situation to her and ask her to help.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.170
Kamijou-san!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:22.620
Ah, yes?

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.820
You haven't finished fitting your maid outfit.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.070
Hurry and get it done.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:30.680
W-Wait!

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:34.250
I won't allow you to force Saya to wear such provocative clothes!

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.210
N-No!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.790
This is some kind of mistake!

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.860
No guys allowed past this point!

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:52.030
You can go to Oasis and get the paper cups and napkins we'll need tomorrow.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.410
But Saya is-!

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:58.750
I'll go instead.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:03.440
Who knows how many hours it'll take if we leave it to you.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.390
What?!

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.710
I'll go, too.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:07.140
Me, too.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.690
Don't get in their way.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.460
Get in their way?

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.020
You're not very perceptive.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.260
Those two are in love!

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.360
Leave them alone.

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:18.320
Wh-What?!

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.980
No!  Curse you, Yuuma!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:24.880
You're going to steal our sun,
Kamisaka-san, all for yourself.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.210
I'm jealous!

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.260
I'm so jealous, damn it!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.480
Guys are so stupid.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.210
You don't get to say that.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.590
Here you are!

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.360
This is for your class.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.750
Thanks.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.630
So, have you decided on your partner, Haruhi-chan?

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.530
For what?

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.490
Aww, you know.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:52.460
SIGN:  Mizuhosaka Academy School Festival

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.470
The dance party on the last night of the festival!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.750
Now that I think of it...

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.870
There was an event like that...

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.450
If you want, you can have Yuuma-kun.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:04.300
He can rub your shoulders,

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.470
and do the cleaning and washing.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.060
I heartily recommend him!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.560
U-Uhm...

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:14.580
W-We have to get this back.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.010
We can talk about that later!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.450
Oh, Yuuma-kun, you're blushing!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:27.710
My mom is always like that.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:30.480
Saying more than she should.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:36.530
I think it's proof that she cares about you.

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:38.070
Really?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:40.750
I'm sure of it.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:46.130
Haruhi, have you decided who your partner will be?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:51.820
No, I didn't remember it until Otoha-san mentioned it.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:56.770
Uhm...

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.310
If you want,

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.710
I'll be your partner at the dance party...

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.660
Please excuse me.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.920
Minagi-sensei?

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.850
Are you all right?

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:16.380
I have to go on a sudden business trip, so I was kind of distracted...

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.620
Thank you.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.460
It must be a real bother.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.300
It's no big deal.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:32.750
There's just something worrying me.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.540
Something that worries you?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.480
Have you heard of the Shiki Forest?

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:41.700
The forest on the other side of the mountain that's off limits?

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:46.590
Yes.  Lately somebody's been going there.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:49.000
There are barriers up,

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:54.170
but if you see somebody trying to go there while I'm away, it'd help me if you warn them to stop.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.610
I understand.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:56.560
Good-bye.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:04.860
Who was that?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:07.840
Minagi-sensei from the School of Magic.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:11.520
You don't know her because you're in the regular class, right?

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.140
Yeah.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.110
Hello!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.540
Wow, so cute!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.940
Why are you dressed like that?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:34.590
My class is putting on a production of "The Wizard of Oz."

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:36.260
I'm playing Dorothy.

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.880
Ibuki-chan is the tornado!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:50.740
Not like that!  Ibuki-chan is part of the School of Magic, so she's going to actually make wind for us!

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:53.160
Ah, I see.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.740
That sounds fun!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:56.170
I'll definitely go see it!

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.120
Great, please do!

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:02.720
Anyway, what's Yuuma doing?

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:06.330
Sumomo-chan came to see him, too...

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:14.270
No, I just thought Ibuki-chan might be here so I came to find her.

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:16.000
Ibuki-chan?

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.210
I haven't seen her.

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.890
I see.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.610
Thank you.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:28.140
Come to think of, Saya-chan or Shinya-kun are gone, too!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:32.140
Jeez, where did everybody go?

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:43.070
I want to dance with Yuuma-kun!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.040
<i>Charge!</i>

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:53.660
<i>Push, push, push!</i>

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:58.270
T-Takamine-senpai!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.950
Welcome to the Fortune Telling Research Club.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:05.190
U-Uhm, I have to get back to my class...

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.310
I am seeing an bad aura.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:16.960
In the near future, bad things may happen to the person you care about the most.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.670
What do you mean?

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:23.440
It can't mean something bad is going to happen to Yuuma-kun...

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.340
Don't worry.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:28.530
If you buy these three good luck items...

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:30.800
Your future will be rose-colored!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.700
I'll consider it.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.150
<i>Stingy!</i>

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:42.880
<i>She left without buying anything!</i>

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:48.810
Let's just pray that the school festival tomorrow ends peacefully.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.310
I believed in you...

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:20.360
I believed that some day you'd find me!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.810
You're...

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.490
Stop it!

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:38.030
Yuuma-kun... Yuuma-kun!

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.280
<i>Haruhi...</i>

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.270
<i>Are you OK?</i>

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.820
<i>You were tossing in your sleep.</i>

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.660
It's nothing.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:56.570
I just had a bad dream.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:13.260
The boy mage who saved me when I was young.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:21.620
I thought I would always treasure those feelings.

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:23.230
But I...

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:27.160
<i>Ya Zon Dearius Gul Bind.</i>

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.440
Break the barrier.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.640
The barrier...

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.160
Break the barrier in the Shiki Forest.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.060
And bring me the treasure.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.800
Now, bring me the treasure.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.860
I don't know of any treasure...

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.220
Don't try to fool me!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:09.100
You carry the name Kartia,
you must know of the treasure!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.380
If you won't give it to me...

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:16.060
Arx Lutiola Gigantus Liola!

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:27.890
I, Hiiragi Anri, will not forgive those who invade the sanctity of this dormitory!

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:29.870
<i>Laval!</i>

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.630
Are you OK?

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.940
Why am I here?

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.360
Someone used hypnotism magic on you.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:51.110
Haruhi, are you hurt?

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.460
I'm fine.

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:56.500
Could that have been Shikimori Ibuki...

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.800
Welcome back, my Masters.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:15.720
I'll put my heart into serving you.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:16.950
No!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:19.600
I know it's a guy, but I'm in love anyway!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:24.680
I'm scared that I'm liking this so much!

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:29.180
That's impossible.  Why would Shikimori-san attack me?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.630
I have no idea!

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:35.490
She wouldn't do that!

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:38.410
Are you saying you don't believe me?

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:41.010
That's not it, just...

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.910
You don't remember anything?

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.200
Like their voice, or anything special about them...

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:49.630
Break the barrier of the Shiki Forest, and bring me the treasure.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:52.480
The barrier of the Shiki Forest.

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:53.770
Barrier?

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:55.610
Minagi-sensei was telling me about it.

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.690
Somebody's been sneaking into the Shiki Forest.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:00.410
It's got to be Shikimori Ibuki!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:03.340
We don't know that for sure.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.630
You contact Minagi-sensei, Haruhi.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.630
I'll find her.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.270
From Yuuma-kun?

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.180
Would you dance with me at the party tonight?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.220
Eh?

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.340
Yes, I was interrupted.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:31.230
Why did you act without consulting us?

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.580
It's far too risky to rush.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:37.210
The master Kartia isn't in this school right now.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:39.720
Now's our only chance to break the barrier.

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:41.240
Stop this, please!

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:43.140
Ibuki-sama...

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:44.210
What?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.160
Saya...

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:48.050
The retrieval of the treasure is our problem.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:52.820
Natsune-sama wouldn't want us to involve those unrelated to this!

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:53.680
Silence!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.170
Saya!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:01.010
I won't ask for your help anymore!

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:04.590
I'll recover the treasure of the Shikimori myself.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.260
Ibuki-sama!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.640
Ibuki-chan...

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.490
The tornado girl didn't show up.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:40.010
I was looking forward to seeing real magic.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.870
PHONE:  (From: Haruhi) Yuuma-kun, I'm sorry I can only respond like this.  I can't...

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.840
Oh, a love e-mail?

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:52.250
L-Leave me alone.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:05.000
Yuuma-kun, I'm sorry I can only respond like this. I can't go to the dance party.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.930
I want to dance with you.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.960
But I have something I have to do.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:18.630
I told you earlier, didn't I, about the boy who saved me with magic when I was young?

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:23.280
I hoped that boy was you.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:26.350
No, I need it to be you.

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:34.240
I can't do it this year, but next year I want to dance with you.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:09.740
Did you find her?

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.140
We need to find Ibuki-sama no matter what.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.540
If we don't, something terrible will happen.

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:17.700
Right!

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:30.180
Ladies and gentleman!

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:32.920
It's time for the last night party to start!

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.980
<i>Looks like the party's started.</i>

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.070
Yeah.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.580
<i>Did you want to dance with Yuuma-kun?</i>

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.690
Yeah.

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:00.970
<i>It's too bad.</i>

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:02.390
<i>But don't worry.</i>

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:04.630
<i>You still have next year.</i>

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.550
I don't know about that.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.380
Yuuma-kun!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:23.630
Break the barrier.

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:26.120
Do that and I'll release him.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:31.070
Was it really you who attacked me last night, Shikimori-san?!

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:33.050
What of it?

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.120
Yuuma-kun!

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:37.570
Nobody will come to save you like last night.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.880
Now break the barrier on the Shiki Forest and give me the treasure!

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.360
Haruhi...

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.010
I don't know of any treasure.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.000
What?

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:51.450
Give Yuuma-kun back!

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:52.910
Bisaim!

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.020
Have you seen Ibuki-sama?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.960
Has something happened?

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.460
If you see her, please let me know.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.200
Ibuki-chan...

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:29.990
Haruhi...

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:30.980
Why?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.510
Yuuma-kun!

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.130
Haruhi!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:42.400
Did you think you could defeat me, the heir to the Shikimori family?!

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:47.750
Now, if you want me to release him, give me the treasure!

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.340
I told you I don't know of any treasure.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:51.750
But I won't do what you want!

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:54.260
Not with Yuuma-kun, or the barrier to the forest!

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:55.710
Fool!

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.620
Stop it!  Don't use magic for fighting!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:04.180
<i>El Amadai Efs Letei Viola Terabist!</i>

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.100
<i>Kal Ar Lapam!</i>

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:14.990
<i>An Gedol Na Zadia Da Veda!</i>

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:19.600
Ibuki-sama!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:20.580
Hime-chan!

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:21.580
And brother!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.320
Why?

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:24.770
<i>De El Krona!</i>

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.190
<i>Le Vagna!</i>

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.570
Why don't you understand?

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:33.800
Stop using magic to hurt each other!

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:39.830
Wh-What?

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.590
Sumomo!

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.630
Wake up, Sumomo!

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:10.060
No way!

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:11.410
Open your eyes!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.230
Sumomo!

00:23:55.010 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.430 --> 00:23:57.540
Tomorrow is a new day.

00:23:57.540 --> 00:23:58.950
This is Kamisaka Haruhi!

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:03.340
Last time I decided to open each preview with a saying or phrase.

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:04.950
Did you notice?

00:24:04.950 --> 00:24:07.530
I'll stop if it annoys you...

00:24:07.530 --> 00:24:10.300
Don't hold back on my account.

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:15.060
I'll listen to what you have to say and fix any mistakes I've made in the past!

00:24:15.060 --> 00:24:20.150
But there are people who are always dragging their past along with them.

00:24:20.150 --> 00:24:21.740
Next time:  The Past.

00:24:20.370 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>The Past</b>

00:24:21.740 --> 00:24:24.800
It's a slightly sad story about that person.
